  'Please sync your date and time',
  '''PRIVACY NOTICE (KVKK Art. 10 / GDPR Art. 13) This text is for information only; it is not a consent form. 1. Controller Engin ÇIRPAN (Juzzio, independent developer) · engiincr@pm.me 2. Data processed Identity and contact: e-mail, username, display name, profile photo. Service data: messages, media, stories and posts, call logs. Device and security: notification token, device ID, sessions and security events. Preferences and your consent records. Only if you turn it on: approximate location (weather theme, location sharing), microphone/camera (calls), contact matching. 3. How it is collected Electronically through the app, partly automatically. 4. Purposes and legal bases Providing your account and the service (contract); security, abuse and attack prevention, rate limits (legitimate interest); legal obligations; keeping consent records (establishing/defending rights); marketing e-mails only with your separate, optional consent. 5. End-to-end encryption and security In 1:1 chats, messages, photos, videos, voice notes, documents, locations and story replies are encrypted on your device with an X25519 + ML-KEM-768 (post-quantum hybrid) key exchange and AES-256-GCM; private keys never leave your phone and the server and admins cannot read this content. Group and channel messages are protected by TLS, not end-to-end. Also: TLS everywhere, row-level security, rate limits and input validation, PIN-locked chats, session management; no ads or tracking libraries. 6. Recipients and transfers abroad Supabase (database, storage, auth), LiveKit Cloud (call media, no recording), Google Firebase Cloud Messaging (notifications), Deepgram (speech, only while live captions are on), Google Translate / MyMemory (texts you translate), Open-Meteo (location rounded to ~10 km, only with the weather theme). Their servers are outside Türkiye; transfers rely on appropriate safeguards (standard contractual clauses) under KVKK Art. 9 / GDPR Chapter V. Encrypted content exists there only as ciphertext. Data may be disclosed to competent authorities where the law requires. 7. Retention While your account exists; on deletion, data and media are queued for removal. Records required by law or for possible disputes (e.g. consent records) are kept for those periods. 8. Your rights Access, information, rectification, erasure, notification of recipients, objection to automated decisions, compensation (KVKK Art. 11) and, in the EU, portability and restriction (GDPR). Contact engiincr@pm.me from your registered e-mail; free reply within 30 days. You can complain to the Personal Data Protection Board (KVKK Art. 14) or your EU supervisory authority. Full text: Settings → Help & Support → Privacy, data rights & legal.''',
  '''MARKETING E-MAIL CONSENT (optional) I agree to receive commercial e-mails about Juzzio news, campaigns, events and announcements at my registered e-mail address, and I consent to my e-mail address and name being processed for this purpose. • This is OPTIONAL and does not affect your use of the app in any way. • You can withdraw at any time, free of charge and without giving a reason, in Settings → Notifications or via the link in every e-mail; withdrawals are processed within 3 business days. • Your consent and withdrawal are recorded with their date. • Details of processing are in the Privacy Notice.''',
